理时的分块方式。\n\n## 🥒unload_dit（卸载DiT模型）：\n解码前卸载DiT模型以降低速度显着存高，但会小幅降低。\n\n## 🥒local_range(上下文参考)\nlocal_range 值越大： 模型需要同时处理更多的视频帧数据。这意味着更高的计算成本、更大的显存占用和更长的处理时间。\nlocal_range 值越小： 模型处理的帧数较少，因此计算速度会更快，显存占用更低。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "使用说明：", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [367.8783874511719, 532.35888671875], "pos": [100.71639251708984, 2768.994140625], "id": 231, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "any", "links": [2059, 2060], "label": "any", "type": "*", "localized_name": "any"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": [true, true], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 2065, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_cache"}, "name": "purge_cache", "label": "purge_cache", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_cache"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_models"}, "name": "purge_models", "label": "purge_models", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_models"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "LayerUtility: PurgeVRAM V2", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [219.63046264648438, 82], "pos": [170.5853271484375, 2608.662353515625], "id": 202, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: PurgeVRAM V2"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "images", "links": [2031], "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": [2, "right", true, null], "inputs": [{"name": "image_1", "link": 2030, "label": "image_1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image_1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image_2", "link": 2060, "label": "image_2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image_2"}, {"widget": {"name": "inputcount"}, "name": "inputcount", "label": "inputcount", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "inputcount"}, {"widget": {"name": "direction"}, "name": "direction", "label": "direction", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "direction"}, {"widget": {"name": "match_image_s